=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@029jrr/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c7e31741/uploads/origins/ae22c1d7-0f98-4046-8adf-0001d3c7ba4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=004d7b9ef48680ab75b2f1ea5397e936", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c7e31741/uploads/origins/ae22c1d7-0f98-4046-8adf-0001d3c7ba4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=004d7b9ef48680ab75b2f1ea5397e936, https://si.imgix.net/c7e31741/uploads/origins/ae22c1d7-0f98-4046-8adf-0001d3c7ba4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3021831d0a2fc6439a344abbcbd66659 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c7e31741/uploads/origins/ae22c1d7-0f98-4046-8adf-0001d3c7ba4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=053ca9e1a69d5e89b0caf37b2021d40b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼いします。\n\nこの度は緋崎ガンマのバストアップイラストの制作をお願いいたします。\n衣装は5thライブのを希望しております。\n背景は白で大丈夫です。\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@029jrr/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c66bdf45/uploads/origins/12222541-ecb5-4ec5-939f-8c820b9e62e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34799d7b3e038e7b3aac9376c3e672e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c66bdf45/uploads/origins/12222541-ecb5-4ec5-939f-8c820b9e62e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34799d7b3e038e7b3aac9376c3e672e2, https://si.imgix.net/c66bdf45/uploads/origins/12222541-ecb5-4ec5-939f-8c820b9e62e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6f0988bc949407a749b3420107451ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c66bdf45/uploads/origins/12222541-ecb5-4ec5-939f-8c820b9e62e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f49e8cd94d5b5a173a1433aedf1eee7c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ジロル-sensei. Thank you for looking at this request.\nI think your clothing designs are really unique and very cute, especially the vibrant pops of color you add in the clothes, and the unique appeal designs too! (o´▽`o)\n\nI would humbly like to ask for outfit designs for my VTuber.\nI'll leave a lot of the clothing design up to you, but my main points would be girly, fashionista, dreamy, and pretty please. I like the ideas of hime gyaru, mori kei, restaurant, and Japanese traditional like miko clothes, but whatever you feel happy and fun while designing.\n\nMy Vtuber, MinxMilk, is a very comfortable, soft, and kind girl.\nHer heart is really for being a peace maker and very fluffy feeling.\nMinxMilk is a milk maiden and a shrine maiden: traveling in dreams, different dimensions, and real life to exorcise evil and give blessings to all those in need. MinxMilk is really good at reiki and healing others as well too.\n\nHer family is originally humble farm folk, but her powers awakened slowly over time, and since then she has been perfecting what she can do.\nShe sells yummy foods and drinks like pearl milktea and ice cream crepes.\nHer favorite animals are bunnies, even though she is like a minks. But she loves all animals, especially fluffy ones, since she understands animals the best.\nShe loves video games, arts and crafts, manga/anime, traveling, gardening, and cooking.\n\nShe's about 160cm tall. With black/white hair, and red/blue eyes.\nUsually I have her hair in giant huge ponytails with ribbons, but please go right ahead and feel as creative as you would like with different designs.\nBut I highly request the hair be luscious, thick, and suitable for a dreamy girl. Even more bigger than the references, please.\nShe's also kind of sexy, but in a cute and fun way. She likes to tease, but does her best to not be judgemental.\n\nMilkCart: MinxMilk's food cart\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/19sMlVWDOMxPMFnOb6XjK3nA7DCO4mYzG/view?usp=sharing\n\n\"MiMi\": MinxMilk's Mascot\nA rabbit and cat magica